// Feature: Chapter list — subject hero with progress, continue CTA on the first available chapter, and per-chapter status (শেষ / রিটেক প্রয়োজন / শুরু হয়নি / লকড) derived from the quiz-pass chain
// Goal: As a student on a subject's chapter page I see every chapter with its unlock state and mastery, plus a continue button on my next chapter, so that I resume exactly where my quiz-pass chain left off wi
//
// PRIMARY deterministic page (v128): generated BEFORE convert-pages. It
// compiles by construction, carries the story-spec data-testids, and makes
